# T-1542 / T-1539: Old payload constructor syntax [type [CtorName field: Type]]
# is rejected at parse time after T-1539 lands.
# The error message directs to the new syntax: [type CtorName: [field: Type]].
[type [File path: String]]
=== error
payload constructor syntax has changed: use `File: [path: String]` instead of `[File path: String]`
